            {{-- <div class="FAQ_main_cntnr__5k1xP" id="faq">
                <div class="FAQ_data_cntnr__jqkhN">
                    <h2 class="FAQ_title__ieeVY">Frequently asked Questions</h2>
                    <div class="FAQ_faq_cntnr__Ldw5Q">
                        <div class="FAQ_qna_cntnr__uCCF2">
                            <p class="FAQ_ques__n_w2h">What is TradeIQ?</p>
                            <p class="FAQ_ans__dQU4r FAQ_show_ans__1iWjO">TradeIQ is a power-packed trading seminar, designed to bridge the knowledge gap across all levels, from beginners to seasoned traders. It is designed to empower individuals with practical trading strategies, expert insights, and a deep understanding of trading essentials to help them trade.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="FAQ_qna_cntnr__uCCF2">
                            <p class="FAQ_ques__n_w2h">What is InvestIQ?</p>
                            <p class="FAQ_ans__dQU4r">InvestIQ is a comprehensive event designed to empower individuals with knowledge about various investment opportunities and strategies across financial markets. It covers topics like equity, mutual funds, fixed-income investments, alternative assets, cryptocurrencies, and insurance, providing a holistic understanding of wealth creation and financial planning.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="FAQ_qna_cntnr__uCCF2">
                            <p class="FAQ_ques__n_w2h">Who should attend TradeIQ?</p>
                            <p class="FAQ_ans__dQU4r">TradeIQ is for anyone wanting to trade smarter, whether just starting, trying to fix what's not working, or looking to level up your trading game. From beginners to experienced traders and crypto fans, if you're serious about making better decisions in the market, TradeIQ is where you’ll find the knowledge you need.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="FAQ_qna_cntnr__uCCF2">
                            <p class="FAQ_ques__n_w2h">Who should attend InvestIQ?</p>
                            <p class="FAQ_ans__dQU4r">InvestIQ is ideal for aspiring and beginner investors looking to build a strong financial foundation, retail investors seeking to diversify their portfolios, professionals aiming to deepen their understanding of modern and traditional investing tools, and students interested in financial literacy and wealth management concepts.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="FAQ_qna_cntnr__uCCF2">
                            <p class="FAQ_ques__n_w2h">What can attendees expect from TradeIQ?</p>
                            <p class="FAQ_ans__dQU4r">Attendees can expect expert-led sessions, trading strategy breakdowns, real-world trading insights, practical tips, live Q&amp;As, networking opportunities, and valuable takeaways to boost their trading journey.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="FAQ_qna_cntnr__uCCF2">
                            <p class="FAQ_ques__n_w2h">What can attendees expect from InvestIQ?</p>
                            <p class="FAQ_ans__dQU4r">Attendees will gain in-depth insights into diverse investment instruments, including equities, mutual funds, bonds, real estate, and cryptocurrencies. They will also receive practical tips on portfolio diversification, tax planning, and risk management, along with expert-led sessions on current and future trends in the financial markets.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="FAQ_qna_cntnr__uCCF2">
                            <p class="FAQ_ques__n_w2h">Will there be opportunities for networking with other investors at InvestIQ?</p>
                            <p class="FAQ_ans__dQU4r">Absolutely! InvestIQ provides a platform for participants to connect with like-minded individuals, industry professionals, and experts. Networking sessions during breaks and after sessions will help attendees exchange ideas, share experiences, and build valuable relationships in the investment community.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="FAQ_qna_cntnr__uCCF2">
                            <p class="FAQ_ques__n_w2h">Will there be opportunities for networking with other traders at TradeIQ?</p>
                            <p class="FAQ_ans__dQU4r">Absolutely! TradeIQ provides a platform for participants to connect with like-minded traders, industry professionals, and experts. Networking sessions during breaks and after sessions will help attendees exchange ideas, share experiences, and build valuable relationships in the trading community.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="FAQ_qna_cntnr__uCCF2">
                            <p class="FAQ_ques__n_w2h">How can I register for the event?</p>
                            <p class="FAQ_ans__dQU4r">The event passes can be bought directly from the website, and all updates shall be communicated via your registered email and phone number.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="FAQ_qna_cntnr__uCCF2">
                            <p class="FAQ_ques__n_w2h">Will there be food provided during the event?</p>
                            <p class="FAQ_ans__dQU4r">Yes, food will be provided during the event to keep you energized and focused as you dive into the world of investing with InvestIQ.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="FAQ_qna_cntnr__uCCF2">
                            <p class="FAQ_ques__n_w2h">Do I need any prior knowledge or tools to attend?</p>
                            <p class="FAQ_ans__dQU4r">No prior experience is necessary! TradeIQ and InvestIQ are designed for all levels. However, having a basic understanding of financial markets is helpful. A laptop or smartphone for interactive sessions is recommended.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="FAQ_qna_cntnr__uCCF2">
                            <p class="FAQ_ques__n_w2h">Is there a refund policy for ticket purchases?</p>
                            <p class="FAQ_ans__dQU4r">Unfortunately, we do not have a refund policy for ticket purchases. However, we are confident that the value and insights provided during the sessions will make your experience worthwhile. If you have any concerns, please feel free to reach out to our support team, and we’d be happy to assist!</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
